 B1895 AND B1897 NAME NO SESSION.

Each line named the session whose reading the arc answers. A verdict line is published on the verdict ledger. The lines now say "a session that did not write them" and "a session that did not write it". Who it was stays where it was: in each page's opening and in each verdict file's citation of the seat. A dated note in each page's section of what is disclosed says what was changed; the old words are not kept in the line itself, because the name is what leaves it.

